Subject: ubus, rpcd: update to 2026-10-28

rpcd no longer names its runtime files after the session id and enforces
session ACLs for ubus callers that are not root; the second needs the
callback libubus gained on the same day.

OpenWrt commits 09538fccfc, 8ac5e0118c and f79894ab57, taken as they
are.

